robot-browser (3.0.1-1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Show SCADA server status in the toolbar, read from the /run/robot files
    robot-scada-client publishes: grey when no server or service is detected,
    orange when the terminal is not provisioned, green when connected
  * Show the provisioning MAC in the SCADA dialog, taken from the wired
    interface, so a terminal can be provisioned without a shell
  * Add the Robot mascot head as SVG, traced from the tray pixmaps, and use it
    for the indicator and the Info dialog
  * Tighten toolbar spacing so WiFi, LAN and the SCADA head all fit on a 720px
    panel

